                      <h2>Transaction Manifest</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p>Radix transactions give you complete visibility and control before you sign, with a &quot;manifest&quot; of meaningful instructions the Radix Wallet can summarize. Unlike other networks, Radix transactions directly describe the movements of your assets, and you can add guarantees for the desired outcome.<br><br>With the Radix Wallet, you can sign transactions with confidence, knowing that it&#x27;s showing you exactly what will happen to your assets.<br><br>With Radix, users get transparent, secure, and user friendly transactions that are ready for mass adoption.</p>
