                    </div>
                    <p>To make a wallet experience that’s safe, fully decentralized, and as easy as using a typical banking app, Radix had to rethink how accounts on a blockchain work. They’re called <strong>Smart Accounts</strong>.<br><br>Unlike regular blockchain accounts, Smart Accounts on Radix aren’t just an address. They’re functional containers for assets that have multi-signature signing and multi-factor recovery built right in – on the network. This means that the Radix Wallet can rely on those security features, but if you lose your phone, the smart account lets you recover access without a seed phrase and without trusting a centralized service.</p>
