                    </div>
                    <p>Web 3.0 demands a better login solution than Web 2.0. Passwords are a hassle and a security risk, and relying on giants like Apple, Google, and Microsoft for your login secrets isn&#x27;t ideal.<br><br>Personas are like Smart Accounts for identity. They offer the same on-ledger multifactor security as Smart Accounts, but instead of holding tokens, they control access to your login. <br><br>With Personas, the Radix Wallet delivers passwordless, personalized logins that are secure, decentralized, and anonymous.</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="div-block-277"><img src="/images/wallet-mobile-3.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/wallet-mobile-3-p-500.png 500w, /images/wallet-mobile-3.webp 772w" alt="" class="image-52"></div>
